!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: Refrigeration:WalkIn ===========
! Example of walk-in freezer in a single zone
! Tyler Refrigeration, Model LA-E Walk-in Meat Cooler,
! Date Source: Tyler Spec Sheet, SG01092, Rev. 8/93
! walk-in meat cooler dimensions at 10'(w) x 14'(L) x 9'(H) (3.05 x 4.27 x 2.74 m )
! 89 mm panels with R24.1 (U .235 W/m2-C)
! Floor is 100 mm panel with R27.4 (U .207 W/m2-C) (based on rating of 1.7 But/ft2 load at nominal ground temp of 75F)
! 12100 Btuh  estimated total load including air exchange, lighting, fans, etc.
! Smallest cooler available 16,000 Btuh  @ 25 F suction temperature
! 12100 Btuh = 3536 W,    16,000 Btuh = 4690 W
! Tyler Refrigeration, Model PFE-160M High Performance Unit Cooler
! Fan - 7.1 amps @ 115 VAC x 0.9 power factor = 734.9 W
! Lights - 2 ea. 60 W bulbs = 120 W
! Defrost - electric type, 5512 W from Tyler spec sheet
! Anti-sweat heater control type none
! Suction - 20 F (-6.67 C)
! Cooler Temp - 28 F (-2.22 C)

